```

Cleanup after the demo: close the PR (`gh pr close feature/zimmproductcard-live-demo`) and delete the branch (`git push origin --delete feature/zimmproductcard-live-demo`) — either alone triggers `teardown-preview.yml`; doing both is a safe, redundant belt-and-braces.

---

## Known gaps / explicit simplifications (for Marcel's approval, not silent)
- Bag button has no loading-spinner slot — not fixed (shared-component scope creep).
- `onNotifyMe`/`onRemove` are demo-only toasts, not real mutations — only add-to-bag was fixed as needing to be real.
- `WithSalePrice`'s `originalPrice` is always synthetic (×1.4) — a search hit has no clean "on promotion" signal.
- `'size'` variation-attribute id is assumed, not verified against a live response this session — mapper degrades gracefully if wrong.
- Badge (`c_productBadges`) is best-effort — gracefully `undefined` if absent from the search-hit shape.
- No `defineMessages`/i18n entries for new demo-only strings (toast titles, captions) — plain hardcoded English, acceptable per the confirmed lighter bar.
- No Storybook/Vitest coverage added for the new mapper or section — confirmed acceptable for this throwaway ask.

### Critical Files for Implementation
- /Users/marcel.a.n.navarro/Dev/zimmermann-pwa/overrides/app/pages/home/liveProductCardDemoMapper.ts (new)
- /Users/marcel.a.n.navarro/Dev/zimmermann-pwa/overrides/app/pages/home/liveProductCardDemoSection.tsx (new)
